                "text": "The Republicans' One Big, Ugly Bill is the largest Medicaid cut ever, and it takes health care away from 17 million Americans, including 322,984 Virginians. \n\nAnd it will make health care costs go up for everyone else.\n\nI am voting NO. https://t.co/gVKJQj2lA5",
